				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "# Jadeite for Pharo\n\nJadeite for Pharo is available when you want a more traditional GemStone development tool alongside the Catalyst DevKit.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "vP/tMs3LSICJ/DKh3kM11g=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Launch\n\n```sh\nbvc j4p\n```\n\nThis builds Jadeite for Pharo if needed, then launches it.\n"
			},
			{
				"__type": "textSnippet",
				"children": {
					"__type": "snippets",
					"items": []
				},
				"createEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"createTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"editEmail": {
					"__type": "email",
					"emailString": "<unknown>"
				},
				"editTime": {
					"__type": "time",
					"time": {
						"__type": "dateAndTime",
						"dateAndTimeString": "2026-05-14T14:00:07.115881+10:00"
					}
				},
				"uid": {
					"__type": "uid",
					"uidString": "oYDv4MqDRmC/9PXiiYPCFQ=="
				},
				"paragraphStyle": {
					"__type": "textStyle"
				},
				"string": "## Configuration\n\nThe main config values are:\n\n```sh\nJ4P_INSTALL_DIR\nJ4P_PHARO_VERSION\nPHARO_INSTALL_DIR\nPHARO_VERSION\n```\n\nLeave them alone unless the project has a clear reason to change them.\n"
			}
		]
